Third-party test files
----------------------
The following files in this folder are copies of test files from
msgreader (https://github.com/HiraokaHyperTools/msgreader), commit
3a5a9359a0fca87d2ece0d3e44317c876bfdf327, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
They are used unchanged, only renamed:

- msg-simple.msg       <- test/Simple.msg
- msg-attachments.msg  <- test/attachmentsOrder.msg
- msg-nested.msg       <- test/msgInMsgInMsg.msg
- msg-ansi.msg         <- test/nonUnicodeMail.msg
- msg-cjk.msg          <- test/Hello +CJK.msg

The following file in this folder is a copy of a test file from Apache POI
(https://github.com/apache/poi), commit
ae62bb5116b9aee19ebd5834e3a82066132c9f7f, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
It is used unchanged, only renamed:

- refused-encrypted.ppt <- test-data/slideshow/Password_Protected-hello.ppt

These files are test data only and are not part of the npm package.
